The bug was caused by changes introduced by the IBM JDK compatibility patch, which affected the handling of Object Identifiers (OIDs) in the SPNEGO authentication process. The previous method of obtaining OIDs was incompatible with the new JDK, leading to failures in establishing secure contexts for Kerberos authentication.

